      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استأمنهُ</span></b>  <i>He asked,</i> or <i>demanded, of him</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأَمَان</span> [i. e. <i>security</i> or <i>safety,</i> or <i>protection</i> or
